{
  "sheet": "controls",
  "about": "One row per player control. input is the Garry's Mod bind command the key runs (so it follows the player's own key bindings), or mouse_middle / double_jump for inputs polled by the mod. handled_by says which code catches it: swep (the Block Hand weapon), bind (client bind hook), poll (client Think), keypress (server KeyPress). when: hand = only while holding the Block Hand, physgun = only while holding the Physics Gun (R stays GMod's unfreeze there), always. action must name a function in MCC.Actions. arg is passed to it (none = no argument). hint is the on-screen help text; none hides the row from the help.",
  "columns": [
    "id",
    "input",
    "handled_by",
    "when",
    "action",
    "arg",
    "default_key",
    "hint"
  ],
